# The Xcode project is generated by XcodeGen but committed anyway, as in the
# other PlumpBug apps: Xcode Cloud clones the repo and needs a project with a
# shared scheme to build, and it can't run `xcodegen`. project.yml stays the
# source of truth. After editing it, run `xcodegen` and commit the regenerated
# project alongside your change; `Tools/check_project_sync.sh` verifies the two
# agree. HomeDashboardTV/Info.plist is generated and committed for the same reason.

# User state
xcuserdata/
.DS_Store

# Build artifacts
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcresult

# SwiftPM
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved
